                          <p class="text-xs text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 font-bold mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
                              <i class="fas fa-info-circle"></i> Nota da Assistente
                          </p>
                          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 italic leading-relaxed">
                              "Paciente prefere atendimento via Google Meet. Link já enviado via WhatsApp."
